        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "What kind of no-good ruffians would break into my castle and steal my treasures?! It's that rotten Captain Syrup and that Black Sugar Gang! I'm looking out for bad guys and scavenging for coins as I track down my treasures. If I don't get them all the first time, that's OK. I can go back again and again until I find them all. Captain Syrup doesn't stand a chance against me!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¿Qué clase de malhechores inútiles se atreverían a irrumpir en mi castillo y robar mis tesoros? ¡Es ese podrido del Captain Syrup y la Black Sugar Gang! Vigilo a los malos y busco monedas mientras persigo mis tesoros. Si no los consigo todos a la primera, no pasa nada: puedo volver una y otra vez hasta encontrarlos todos. ¡Captain Syrup no tiene nada que hacer contra mí!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
